            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3246",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "何以真，很高兴认识你。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1771.199951171875,
            "positionY": 150.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fdf4d05b-8d12-4a9b-971b-b7a1dc6ebb7f",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3247",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "哈哈！我才是很高兴认识你呢！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2089.599853515625,
            "positionY": 150.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "4a0bd67b-b8d3-49d5-b9a3-40a001b083d2",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3248",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "抱歉哦，虽然我还想跟你多聊一会儿。但我还得赶回道观把事情报告给师父。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2408.0,
            "positionY": 151.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ec9cefc7-cedd-4bcd-adaf-e1ebae76809a",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3249",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "没事，我也差不多该去定好的酒店了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2726.39990234375,
            "positionY": 152.8000030517578,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c2abcd4e-65f7-43f7-be52-ecc734c72951",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3250",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "（看似经过了这么久，实际上我到达芸台的时间却比预计提前了。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3053.599853515625,
            "positionY": 153.60000610351563,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "dfb01caa-4bf8-421e-a005-bd93a18c3a2b",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3251",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "不过你手里的那个镜子，真是神奇啊，居然能够瞬间移动。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3371.199951171875,
            "positionY": 154.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "58bf8152-592a-43da-a0f6-f779f07eb331",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3252",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "啊！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3689.599853515625,
            "positionY": 154.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c4e52f60-33c4-490e-941c-a9f966e2f48c",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3253",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "何以真，我偷偷告诉你，你千万不要向别人提起这个镜子哦！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4008.0,
            "positionY": 156.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "188cad23-34b8-434e-a387-5263ecdd93fb",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3254",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "欸？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4326.400390625,
            "positionY": 157.60000610351563,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
